WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:07.140
You need 12 to 18 index cards, crayons or markers, and a ball of yarn.

2
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:13.300
Draw one card each for sun, grass, grasshopper, frog, snake, and hawk.

3
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:15.340
Line them up by who eats whom.

4
00:00:15.760 --> 00:00:17.760
Each person holds one to three cards.

5
00:00:18.220 --> 00:00:21.280
Start at the grass and pass the yarn from each food to its eater.

6
00:00:22.100 --> 00:00:24.620
Pull one card out and give the yarn a small tug.

7
00:00:25.140 --> 00:00:26.760
Anyone who feels it raises a hand.

8
00:00:27.260 --> 00:00:30.320
Take out the grass, and usually nearly every hand goes up.

9
00:00:30.950 --> 00:00:32.570
Stay with your child the whole time.

10
00:00:33.030 --> 00:00:37.290
Never put yarn around a neck, and do not wrap it tightly around fingers or wrists.

11
00:00:37.830 --> 00:00:39.390
Nobody walks while holding yarn.
